OL,3,GNEWSAPlan to create Highland's first
OL,4,Aarea of linguistic significance
OL,5,
OL,6,FHighland Council is to hold a
OL,7,Fconsultation on plans to make Skye and
OL,8,FRaasay its first area of linguistic
OL,9,Fsignificance (ALS) for Gaelic.
OL,11,FThe local authority has proposed using
OL,12,Fpowers in the new Scottish Languages
OL,13,FAct to introduce the designation.
OL,15,FPlaces where 20% of residents have
OL,16,FGaelic skills qualify as an ALS, but
OL,17,Fareas with strong cultural or
OL,18,Fhistorical links to the language can
OL,19,Falso meet the criteria.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
